  "notes": "This resource records absences rather than facts, so its cited sources are the public pages that mark where the public record stops. If a future review finds any of these workflows published publicly, move the content into the appropriate faculty resource and remove the gap. Authenticated entry points are deliberately absent from sources[]: docs/integration-contracts.md states a login response cannot count as public verification. Verified 2026-08-31 by anonymous request, every intranet.ncf.edu path tested returned the myNCF login portal and ses.ncf.edu redirected to single sign-on; that boundary is described in the resource prose instead of cited as evidence."
